  "notes": "Warm paper-toned (#f3f0e8 / #fffdf8) catch-up dashboard for missed lab-meeting recordings, framed by a deep teal sidebar and a cream bottom audio player. Signature device: every timeline is a segmented chapter bar color-coded Listen (teal) / Skim (pale teal) / Skip (taupe), with darker shading for already-heard portions, orange dot for 'your name' and lilac diamond for decisions, explained by a persistent legend in the sidebar. Amber (#fff8e6 bg, #e8b563 border, #d9730d button) is reserved for deadline/personal items: header countdown pill '3 days', presentation card, 'For you' callouts, name highlights (mark) in excerpts. Copy is highly personalized (time saved at 1.5x, mention counts). Player has toggles 'Slow on decisions' and 'Skip Skip chapters', playback policies tied to chapter classification. Keyboard-first: '/' search hint, shortcut sheet modal."
